{"id":"35073b74f84433b3","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-pairing.md","title":"标准配对与编码","display":"df-pairing — 标准配对与编码","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-pairing","aliases":["20-df-pairing"],"display":"df-pairing — 标准配对与编码","chapter":"supplement","section":"notation","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Notation: Standard Pairing Function","source_pdf_pages":[33],"source_printed_pages":["xxxii"],"depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-pairing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-pairing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pairing — 标准配对与编码"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"notation"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Notation: Standard Pairing Function"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>33</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>xxxii</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\omega\">\\(x,y\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pairing}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\langle x,y\\rangle:=\\frac{(x+y)^2+3x+y}{2},\\\\\n\\pi_1(n):=\\mu x\\le n\\ \\exists y\\le n\\ [n=\\langle x,y\\rangle],\\quad\n\\pi_2(n):=\\mu y\\le n\\ \\exists x\\le n\\ [n=\\langle x,y\\rangle],\\\\\n\\langle x\\rangle:=x,\\quad\n\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle:=\\langle\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}\\rangle,x_k\\rangle.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pairing}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\langle x,y\\rangle:=\\frac{(x+y)^2+3x+y}{2},\\\\\n\\pi_1(n):=\\mu x\\le n\\ \\exists y\\le n\\ [n=\\langle x,y\\rangle],\\quad\n\\pi_2(n):=\\mu y\\le n\\ \\exists x\\le n\\ [n=\\langle x,y\\rangle],\\\\\n\\langle x\\rangle:=x,\\quad\n\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle:=\\langle\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}\\rangle,x_k\\rangle.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每条对角线 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x+y=t\">\\(x+y=t\\)</span> 的像是连续区间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[t(t+1)/2,(t+1)(t+2)/2)\">\\([t(t+1)/2,(t+1)(t+2)/2)\\)</span>，所以配对是双射且逆唯一。有限有界搜索给出原始递归逆。多元关系统一通过固定元数的配对编码为自然数集合；可变长度序列另编码长度。</p>\n<p>来源：Notation: Standard Pairing Function；印刷页 xxxii；PDF 第 33 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"x,y\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"k\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pairing}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\langle x,y\\rangle:=\\frac{(x+y)^2+3x+y}{2},\\\\\n\\pi_1(n):=\\mu x\\le n\\ \\exists y\\le n\\ [n=\\langle x,y\\rangle],\\quad\n\\pi_2(n):=\\mu y\\le n\\ \\exists x\\le n\\ [n=\\langle x,y\\rangle],\\\\\n\\langle x\\rangle:=x,\\quad\n\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle:=\\langle\\langle x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}\\rangle,x_k\\rangle.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"x+y=t","display":false},{"tex":"[t(t+1)/2,(t+1)(t+2)/2)","display":false}],"bytes":1265,"backlinks":[{"id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-recursive]